{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "energyco-loyalty-v1",
    "name": "EnergyCo Loyalty API",
    "description": "EnergyCo Loyalty API collection.\n\nImport alongside EnergyCo.Loyalty.postman_environment.json and select the EnergyCo Loyalty - Docker environment.\n\nProduct catalogue:\n  PRD01  Vortex 95     $1.20  Fuel\n  PRD02  Vortex 98     $1.30  Fuel\n  PRD03  Diesel        $1.10  Fuel\n  PRD04  Twix 55g      $2.30  Shop\n  PRD05  Mars 72g      $5.10  Shop\n  PRD06  SNICKERS 72G  $3.40  Shop\n  PRD07  Bounty 3 63g  $6.90  Shop\n  PRD08  Snickers 50g  $4.00  Shop\n\nActive promotions:\n  PP001  2 pts/$  Any   01-Jan-2020 to 30-Jan-2020\n  PP002  3 pts/$  Fuel  05-Feb-2020 to 15-Feb-2020\n  PP003  4 pts/$  Shop  01-Mar-2020 to 20-Mar-2020\n  DP001  20% off  PRD01+PRD02  01-Jan-2020 to 15-Feb-2020\n  DP002  15% off  PRD04-PRD08  02-Mar-2020 to 20-Mar-2020\n\nDate format: dd-MMM-yyyy e.g. 10-Mar-2020",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Products",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET all products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products"]
            },
            "description": "Returns the full product catalogue. Expects 200 with an array of 8 products."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
